stream
BT /F2 17 Tf 54 730.0 Td (Data Protection & Classification Policy) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 697.0 Td (1. Purpose and Scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 674.0 Td (Hewlett Packard Enterprise \(HPE\) processes a broad spectrum of information assets, including) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 660.0 Td (customer personally identifiable information \(PII\), payment card industry \(PCI\) cardholder data) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 646.0 Td (generated through HPE GreenLake billing operations, and proprietary intellectual property \(IP\). This) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 632.0 Td (Data Protection & Classification Policy establishes how such information is categorized, labeled,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 618.0 Td (and safeguarded across its entire lifecycle. It applies to all employees, contractors, third) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 604.0 Td (parties, and systems that create, access, process, or store HPE data, regardless of format or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 590.0 Td (location.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 564.0 Td (2. Data Classification and Categorization) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 541.0 Td (All HPE information must be assigned a classification level so that appropriate protections can be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 527.0 Td (applied consistently. HPE uses a four-tier categorization scheme:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 507.0 Td (- Public - Information approved for unrestricted release, such as published marketing material,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 493.0 Td (  press releases, and product datasheets. Disclosure poses no harm to HPE or its customers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 479.0 Td (- Sensitive - Internal-use information whose unauthorized disclosure could cause limited harm,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 465.0 Td (  such as internal procedures, org charts, and non-public operational data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 451.0 Td (- Confidential - Information requiring strong protection, including customer PII, contracts, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 437.0 Td (  internal financial records. Unauthorized exposure could cause significant business, legal, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 423.0 Td (  reputational harm.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 409.0 Td (- Restricted - The most tightly controlled category, covering PCI cardholder data from GreenLake) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 395.0 Td (  billing, authentication secrets, source code, and trade-secret IP. Compromise could result in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 381.0 Td (  regulatory penalties, financial loss, or material competitive damage.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 361.0 Td (Each asset must carry a visible classification label at the point of creation. Labeling may be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 347.0 Td (applied through document headers, metadata tags, email markings, or automated data-classification) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 333.0 Td (tooling. When data of differing sensitivities is combined, the resulting set inherits the highest) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 319.0 Td (applicable classification.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 293.0 Td (3. Roles and Responsibilities) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 270.0 Td (Effective data protection depends on clearly assigned accountability:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 250.0 Td (- Data Owners are senior business leaders accountable for specific information domains \(for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 236.0 Td (  example, the GreenLake billing owner for cardholder data\). Owners approve classifications,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 222.0 Td (  authorize access, and are ultimately responsible for the protection of their data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 208.0 Td (- Data Stewards translate owner intent into practice, maintaining data quality, defining) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 194.0 Td (  retention rules, and ensuring the correct categorization and labeling of records within their) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 180.0 Td (  domain.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 166.0 Td (- Data Custodians - typically IT and infrastructure teams - are responsible for the technical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 152.0 Td (  safeguarding, storage, backup, and secure operation of the systems that hold the data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 138.0 Td (- All Users are responsible for handling information in accordance with its classification and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 124.0 Td (  for reporting suspected loss or misuse.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 98.0 Td (4. Data Handling, Storage, and Transmission) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 75.0 Td (Handling requirements scale with classification. Confidential and Restricted data must be encrypted) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
